This repo is **react-tooltip-native**: native-first tooltip and popover for React (Popover API + CSS Anchor Positioning, minimal JS fallback). Zero runtime deps, strict types, tiered core engine, React layer (hook, component, action), unit + E2E tests, size gate, and changesets with npm Trusted Publishing.

**Single source of truth:** [docs/DEV-ARCHITECTURE.md](../../docs/DEV-ARCHITECTURE.md). Library-specific: [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](../../docs/ARCHITECTURE.md), [docs/PRD.md](../../docs/PRD.md), [docs/API_SPECS.md](../../docs/API_SPECS.md). Read these for goals, API contract, engine tiers, repo layout, testing, packaging, and release flow. Follow the implementation order when adding features.
